WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:04,380
In addition, I remember that Chen Zhenghao had a water gun on him

2
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,540
Search it out and give it to me

3
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:14,870
Be too careful!

4
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:16,670
Be careful to make the ten thousand year ship

5
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:19,460
I won't let myself risk trading a little bit

6
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:26,260
Work, throw the water gun to me

7
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:31,300
Believe you, what if after I finish doing this?

8
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,110
You are turning your back on me!

9
00:00:33,110 --> 00:00:35,390
You have no other option now but trust me

10
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:38,660
Don't believe me, you can't break the moral bottom line

11
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:41,460
I'm destined to starve to death on this balcony.

12
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:45,220
You, go back first

13
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,660
Okay, I call you
